WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,180
I thought I wouldn't feel the pain anymore

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,140
I thought dignity was such a thing

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,820
I don't care anymore

4
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,750
What's going on today

5
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,850
Got a fever

6
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:13,090
Burnt and confused

7
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,360
What I want is not that apology

8
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:19,240
What I want is to be respected for the first time in a long time

9
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,950
Be respected as a person

10
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:23,110
That's what I asked for

11
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,980
No more fantasies

12
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:32,490
I want to be discharged from the hospital

13
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:35,010
You're not cured yet, I'm cured

14
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,480
The fever is gone

15
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,160
want to work

16
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,800
You did it on purpose?

17
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:46,300
Do you want everyone to see the gauze on your forehead?

18
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,900
You are indeed not simple

19
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,810
Eating people's faces without knowing their intentions

20
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,890
I see you are so scheming.

21
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:55,610
I'm going to work

22
00:00:55,970 --> 00:00:57,010
Discharge procedures

23
00:00:57,330 --> 00:00:58,250
You do it
